Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":236,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1908989,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":285230,"Name":"Deannak","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1452003553,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1908989,"PostDate":1452003553,"PostContent":"Hello ladies!  I'm just wondering if any brides who have had their wedding at Azul Fives could pr...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannakawecki@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.224.81.241","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1446521008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Deannak","Id":285230,"Name":"Deannak","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.81.241","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79836,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c162008e22ab80972dfb7b8e59a4515","RawContent":"Hello ladies! \n\nI&#039;m just wondering if any brides who have had their wedding at Azul Fives could provide a review for me. Not only on the wedding part, but the resort itself! I&#039;ve been reading reviews on trip advisor, yes I know to take them with a grain of salt, but lately there has been a lot of negative reviews, so I can&#039;t help but be a little concerned! I want to finalize my decision , I love the look of the resort and everything it has to offer, but those are just pictures and info, I would love some trustworthy opinions! With the Canadian dollar being so low, prices have gone pretty high, so I would like to ensure my guests get a great vacation.\n\nThanks in advance for the help, I look forward to reading about your experiences!","Attachments":[],"Id":1908989,"PostDate":1452003553,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello ladies! <br>\nI'm just wondering if any brides who have had their wedding at Azul Fives could provide a review for me. Not only on the wedding part, but the resort itself! I've been reading reviews on trip advisor, yes I know to take them with a grain of salt, but lately there has been a lot of negative reviews, so I can't help but be a little concerned! I want to finalize my decision , I love the look of the resort and everything it has to offer, but those are just pictures and info, I would love some trustworthy opinions! With the Canadian dollar being so low, prices have gone pretty high, so I would like to ensure my guests get a great vacation.<br>\nThanks in advance for the help, I look forward to reading about your experiences!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannakawecki@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.224.81.241","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1446521008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Deannak","Id":285230,"Name":"Deannak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.88.49.88","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79836,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2dea86ffbc4f91d7b0a3a0b4e9549a4","RawContent":"@[member=\"Deannak\"] Hi!! You can find some reviews if you search for Azul Fives. In August @[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] got married at AF - search her and you can read her thread and review. @[member=\"snswedding2016\"] is getting married there on the 9th - you can find her thread on here and her review from the Brides Dress Rehersal. \n\n\nGood luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1908995,"PostDate":1452005721,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285230\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285230-deannak\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Deannak<\/span><\/a> Hi!! You can find some reviews if you search for Azul Fives. In August @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> got married at AF - search her and you can read her thread and review. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281055-snswedding2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">snswedding2016<\/span><\/a> is getting married there on the 9th - you can find her thread on here and her review from the Brides Dress Rehersal. <br><br>\nGood luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Ashley<br><br>\nMy Planning Thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/<\/a> <br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160607\/e\/M+%26amp%3B+A+Wedding\/k\/d689\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\">","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1423105061,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.150.72.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79836,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e3fbb419dcc019bc1323eba958490c11","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Good Morning! &amp;nbsp;I have a bride getting married at Azul Fives in 16 days and everything has been excellent thus far..I am a TA in Canada and know that Karisma handles groups wonderfully. &amp;nbsp;Some resorts that you may want to consider as well are Beach Palace, Hyatt Ziva or Dreams Tulum. &amp;nbsp;What amenities\/activities\/rooms are you looking for in the ideal resort? &amp;nbsp;That will help you narrow down choices. &amp;nbsp;Cheers!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909000,"PostDate":1452006552,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Good Morning! \u00a0I have a bride getting married at Azul Fives in 16 days and everything has been excellent thus far..I am a TA in Canada and know that Karisma handles groups wonderfully. \u00a0Some resorts that you may want to consider as well are Beach Palace, Hyatt Ziva or Dreams Tulum. \u00a0What amenities\/activities\/rooms are you looking for in the ideal resort? \u00a0That will help you narrow down choices. \u00a0Cheers!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><br \/>\n<strong class='bbc'>Canadian Wedding Specialist<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><br \/>\n<strong class='bbc'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'><strong class='bbc'>? We are an award winning travel agency<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"darci@travelbyplatinum.com","IpAddress":"96.53.159.150","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1448908074,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285477.jpg?_r=1448908161","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TADarci","Id":285477,"Name":"TADarci","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.245.163.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79836,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 05 January 2016 - 11:23 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1452021825,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32a84fa9ea705f96963584caaebaf11f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;In case you haven&#039;t seen these, here&#039;s a link to some &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=099d811a8ce59aef94d18cea0316db72&amp;amp;app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&amp;amp;gsc.q=Azul%20Fives&#039;&gt;Azul Fives threads right here on BDW.&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know you said you&#039;d already seen pics from there, I thought I&#039;d share these magical wedding moments that matter our award winning premier photographer, Linc captured there....enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153681635889487.1073741949.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;....from our Azul Fives Wedding Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/12080264_10153681637774487_3208865878728466904_o.jpg\" alt=\"12080264_10153681637774487_3208865878728\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/12087274_10153681637999487_921566260327431168_o.jpg\" alt=\"12087274_10153681637999487_9215662603274\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/12068912_10153681638774487_3403774514175330762_o.jpg\" alt=\"12068912_10153681638774487_3403774514175\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xal1\/t31.0-8\/12068422_10153681639319487_859050653259270216_o.jpg\" alt=\"12068422_10153681639319487_8590506532592\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/12095274_10153681641709487_8717166240318589018_o.jpg\" alt=\"12095274_10153681641709487_8717166240318\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....or for the other suggestion, here&#039;s our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152641474894487.1073741910.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Dreams Tulum Wedding Album &lt;\/a&gt;(showing another option):&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10333545_10152641476789487_8878152133793012032_o.jpg\" alt=\"10333545_10152641476789487_8878152133793\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/10511392_10152641478034487_3469697475172755239_o.jpg\" alt=\"10511392_10152641478034487_3469697475172\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/10582840_10152641481829487_3016457614501443431_o.jpg\" alt=\"10582840_10152641481829487_3016457614501\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/l\/t31.0-8\/10580772_10152641483919487_7963294202156661350_o.jpg\" alt=\"10580772_10152641483919487_7963294202156\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909004,"PostDate":1452021625,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>In case you haven't seen these, here's a link to some <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=099d811a8ce59aef94d18cea0316db72&app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&gsc.q=Azul%20Fives' class='bbc_url' title=''>Azul Fives threads right here on BDW.<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know you said you'd already seen pics from there, I thought I'd share these magical wedding moments that matter our award winning premier photographer, Linc captured there....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153681635889487.1073741949.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>....from our Azul Fives Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/12080264_10153681637774487_3208865878728466904_o.jpg\" alt=\"12080264_10153681637774487_3208865878728\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/12087274_10153681637999487_921566260327431168_o.jpg\" alt=\"12087274_10153681637999487_9215662603274\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/12068912_10153681638774487_3403774514175330762_o.jpg\" alt=\"12068912_10153681638774487_3403774514175\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xal1\/t31.0-8\/12068422_10153681639319487_859050653259270216_o.jpg\" alt=\"12068422_10153681639319487_8590506532592\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/12095274_10153681641709487_8717166240318589018_o.jpg\" alt=\"12095274_10153681641709487_8717166240318\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....or for the other suggestion, here's our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152641474894487.1073741910.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Dreams Tulum Wedding Album <\/a>(showing another option):<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10333545_10152641476789487_8878152133793012032_o.jpg\" alt=\"10333545_10152641476789487_8878152133793\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/10511392_10152641478034487_3469697475172755239_o.jpg\" alt=\"10511392_10152641478034487_3469697475172\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/10582840_10152641481829487_3016457614501443431_o.jpg\" alt=\"10582840_10152641481829487_3016457614501\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/l\/t31.0-8\/10580772_10152641483919487_7963294202156661350_o.jpg\" alt=\"10580772_10152641483919487_7963294202156\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79836,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12095901d461e3d28b6b58870cb73984","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@Deannak&amp;nbsp; Congrats and welcome! This site is wonderful for information as well as ideas and suggestions from other brides.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Azul Fives is a really popular resort and it&#039;s gorgeous! It&#039;s one of the ones that we considered for our vow renewal last October. @[member=\"ashhtayy\"] was totally right. She gave you two great threads to review and believe me, they&#039;re really great threads! But if you do a search you&#039;ll get a lot more. Spend some time reading. I can guarantee that any questions you have more than likely have been asked and answered on the threads, along with things you may not even have thought about. Both of the threads that ashhtayy mentioned are very detailed and have some fantastic details that I know will help you through your planning journey.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Keep us posted on what you decide!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909088,"PostDate":1452145041,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@Deannak\u00a0 Congrats and welcome! This site is wonderful for information as well as ideas and suggestions from other brides.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Azul Fives is a really popular resort and it's gorgeous! It's one of the ones that we considered for our vow renewal last October. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282006\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282006-ashhtayy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ashhtayy<\/span><\/a> was totally right. She gave you two great threads to review and believe me, they're really great threads! But if you do a search you'll get a lot more. Spend some time reading. I can guarantee that any questions you have more than likely have been asked and answered on the threads, along with things you may not even have thought about. Both of the threads that ashhtayy mentioned are very detailed and have some fantastic details that I know will help you through your planning journey.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Keep us posted on what you decide!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79836","Title":"Azul Fives","LastPostDate":1452145041},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
