er","JoinDate":1210024830,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209276.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SgtPepperette","Id":209276,"Name":"SgtPepperette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be916207de55cd43a79440ec750699bc","RawContent":"It looks like the original post is a couple years old... As I&#039;ve posted on a couple other threads (sorry if it&#039;s getting repetitive!), I just got back from a trip to southern Florida to check out wedding locations. We visited two resorts in SW Florida, one in Naples and one on Captiva Island (right by Sanibel Island). I&#039;m happy to share the info I got on these resorts and the surrounding areas if anyone wants it!","Attachments":[],"Id":756382,"PostDate":1247430699,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It looks like the original post is a couple years old... As I've posted on a couple other threads (sorry if it's getting repetitive!), I just got back from a trip to southern Florida to check out wedding locations. We visited two resorts in SW Florida, one in Naples and one on Captiva Island (right by Sanibel Island). I'm happy to share the info I got on these resorts and the surrounding areas if anyone wants it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Ashley & Anthony<\/span><br><span>July 17, 2010<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/99d9367abe.png\">http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/99d9367abe.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wsnusIL\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...sIL\/weight.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"anolinger@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1247375534,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219334.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":243,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"whitechocolate","Id":219334,"Name":"whitechocolate","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8fa28ca42079ff0fd8cc83a6e74c053","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; i&#039;m interested in looking into Marco Island\/ Naples as our destination wedding spot but don&#039;t know where to start. Any pointers?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Serena&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1569658,"PostDate":1326860726,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> i'm interested in looking into Marco Island\/ Naples as our destination wedding spot but don't know where to start. Any pointers?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!!<\/p> <p> Serena<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sefumosa@redwoodexp.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1325188712,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249046.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sfumosa","Id":249046,"Name":"sfumosa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ccc290c3c73bfed083075f21ace61e2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi -&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;    I am also planning to get marry in the Naples\/Marco Island area this summer...and just started my research now.&amp;nbsp; Came across this thread on this site, and was interested in what you found was helpful...or what you decided on for your wedding.&amp;nbsp; Any info would be greatly appreciated!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1609007,"PostDate":1334800945,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi -<\/p> <p> \u00a0\u00a0 I am also planning to get marry in the Naples\/Marco Island area this summer...and just started my research now.\u00a0 Came across this thread on this site, and was interested in what you found was helpful...or what you decided on for your wedding.\u00a0 Any info would be greatly appreciated!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"susanpt@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1334800843,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254221.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yumi","Id":254221,"Name":"yumi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4693878cfb55ce5a246f5499c9ef59c1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We went down to Florida two months ago. Visited the Hilton and Marriot in Marco Island. We also looked at once place in Ft. Myers (Pink Shell Resort). The wedding planner there, Dony, is AMAZING! We also visited Casa Y Bel in Sanibel.&amp;nbsp; If anyone has any questions on these places, let me know :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1648922,"PostDate":1344021141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We went down to Florida two months ago. Visited the Hilton and Marriot in Marco Island. We also looked at once place in Ft. Myers (Pink Shell Resort). The wedding planner there, Dony, is AMAZING! We also visited Casa Y Bel in Sanibel.\u00a0 If anyone has any questions on these places, let me know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"crosenka@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1344014090,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258744.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CBarr2013","Id":258744,"Name":"CBarr2013","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"2105","Title":"Sw Fl Dw","LastPostDate":1448243264},"Pages":{"TotalItems":18,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
