Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"154741acd741e70c20dce019c7e01797","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi CBarr-&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you for sharing where you have visited. What made you choose Marco Island over the others? I would love to hear your thoughts.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you in advance!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1651570,"PostDate":1344731031,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi CBarr-<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you for sharing where you have visited. What made you choose Marco Island over the others? I would love to hear your thoughts.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you in advance!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katyjarcher@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1338582078,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256148.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Arch713","Id":256148,"Name":"Arch713","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"edcde2a32244b7292c2c39ee5babd59e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My fianc\u00a9 and I are looking to have a destination wedding in Florida. Looking at possibly a New Years Eve date for this year. All we have found so far is wedding planners that want you to sign a contract before they discuss anything with you. Would like to find a location\/resort that is small and will be fairly private for us and our wedding guests or an all inclusive place that will handle it. Approximately 30-40 guests. Children will be attending. Any suggestions or recommendations are appreciated&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742444,"PostDate":1365176678,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My fianc\u00a9 and I are looking to have a destination wedding in Florida. Looking at possibly a New Years Eve date for this year. All we have found so far is wedding planners that want you to sign a contract before they discuss anything with you. Would like to find a location\/resort that is small and will be fairly private for us and our wedding guests or an all inclusive place that will handle it. Approximately 30-40 guests. Children will be attending. Any suggestions or recommendations are appreciated<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mbess411@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365176616,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268217.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mbess411","Id":268217,"Name":"mbess411","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8dbdbe68f367439f80129390aaf05b9c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My fianc\u00a9 and I are looking to have a destination wedding in Florida. Looking at possibly a New Years Eve date for this year. All we have found so far is wedding planners that want you to sign a contract before they discuss anything with you. Would like to find a location\/resort that is small and will be fairly private for us and our wedding guests or an all inclusive place that will handle it. Approximately 30-40 guests. Children will be attending. Any suggestions or recommendations are appreciated&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742445,"PostDate":1365176706,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My fianc\u00a9 and I are looking to have a destination wedding in Florida. Looking at possibly a New Years Eve date for this year. All we have found so far is wedding planners that want you to sign a contract before they discuss anything with you. Would like to find a location\/resort that is small and will be fairly private for us and our wedding guests or an all inclusive place that will handle it. Approximately 30-40 guests. Children will be attending. Any suggestions or recommendations are appreciated<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mbess411@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365176616,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268217.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mbess411","Id":268217,"Name":"mbess411","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e56f3aeffd2f589cf6edee22c026898","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi -&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am having my wedding in Naples, FL at the Hilton - Electa is great to work with. My wedding is going to be small - about 40 people.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I did look into an all inclusive option and there is only one in Florida that Patty from the Travel agency that sponsors this site recommended - it is the Club Med Sandpiper. It is a family friendly resort and is about $170\/person\/night.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Many places I talked with had a wedding coordinator at the hotel - they should provide information. And many websites let you submit an RFP online. New Year&#039;s might be a tricky one at some places - I hear it is popular :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1743659,"PostDate":1365537099,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi -<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am having my wedding in Naples, FL at the Hilton - Electa is great to work with. My wedding is going to be small - about 40 people.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I did look into an all inclusive option and there is only one in Florida that Patty from the Travel agency that sponsors this site recommended - it is the Club Med Sandpiper. It is a family friendly resort and is about $170\/person\/night.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Many places I talked with had a wedding coordinator at the hotel - they should provide information. And many websites let you submit an RFP online. New Year's might be a tricky one at some places - I hear it is popular <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kgtc.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362512552,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266932.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tristanc","Id":266932,"Name":"tristanc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62c5c5064108999c8b09211584d6b744","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congratulations on your wedding! (which must have just happened). I would love to know where you ended up having your wedding and what you thought of the Marriott Marco Beach. I was looking at the Marriott Marco Island and Marco Beach Ocean Resort along with the Ritz Carlton Naples and am hoping to have my wedding in Dec. 2013. Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1751224,"PostDate":1367011656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congratulations on your wedding! (which must have just happened). I would love to know where you ended up having your wedding and what you thought of the Marriott Marco Beach. I was looking at the Marriott Marco Island and Marco Beach Ocean Resort along with the Ritz Carlton Naples and am hoping to have my wedding in Dec. 2013. Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"zavolinj@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.48.208.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1367011553,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269010.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jaz8787","Id":269010,"Name":"jaz8787","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"373374a62b24e4db4d98b3f7d4ef7b97","RawContent":"Have you been to The South Seas Resort?","Attachments":[],"Id":1784590,"PostDate":1375115993,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Have you been to The South Seas Resort?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kennarjl@dukes.jmu.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1327000120,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250185.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":247,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KristiCay","Id":250185,"Name":"KristiCay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99f6e4e40aed824285ec2edc83361f93","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My future father in law lives in Bonita Springs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am looking for a resort that will offer us a good deal on rooms for our guests. I am planning a simple, elegant wedding. Perhaps a late afternoon ceremony followed by a cocktail. If you have any suggestion I would be so grateful. So difficult to plan without being onsite.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862523,"PostDate":1406440414,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My future father in law lives in Bonita Springs.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am looking for a resort that will offer us a good deal on rooms for our guests. I am planning a simple, elegant wedding. Perhaps a late afternoon ceremony followed by a cocktail. If you have any suggestion I would be so grateful. So difficult to plan without being onsite.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">I'm lucky I'm in love with my best friend<\/span><\/em>","Email":"lily_1202@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406390649,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279175.jpg?_r=1406605860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lilian84","Id":279175,"Name":"Lilian84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.10.35.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2105,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"193b8c0deedd04aded85ccb43aa90a55","RawContent":"I&#039;m looking to get married in Ft lauderdale on the beach in May with a reception after about 20 guests flying in , Do you have any info on that ?","Attachments":[],"Id":1907790,"PostDate":1448243264,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                 