","JoinDate":1364396066,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267860.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cdnbanker","Id":267860,"Name":"cdnbanker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74225,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64b7d4103102fbbe891096f05333a841","RawContent":"It&#039;s pretty!","Attachments":[],"Id":1766084,"PostDate":1370791365,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It's pretty!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"craddocksl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.10.25.244","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369209172,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269841.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shara1984","Id":269841,"Name":"Shara1984","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74225,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97bf1650dc4813b25abbcd449b8d7c1c","RawContent":"Are you happy with the overall material and beadings etc hun? I have made contact with them abt making knockoff dress for me","Attachments":[],"Id":1766686,"PostDate":1370928480,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Are you happy with the overall material and beadings etc hun? I have made contact with them abt making knockoff dress for me\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria.liong@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370767986,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270389.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vivaliciouschic","Id":270389,"Name":"vivaliciouschic","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"117.213.14.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74225,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98790c054354b04ed2a2cede727b160c","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;Ive just been to one wedding shop (and alright, i confess...my wedding dress will be strapless haha) however there were a wide range of styles - some since quite a while ago sleeved ones (perhaps in light of the fact that i live in mexico and a percentage of the catholic weddings are in more progressive houses of worship), straps, topped sleeves, short dresses, grecian section dresses with a halterneck sort top and so on et cetera as a matter of fact the lion&#039;s share were strapless, yet different alternatives were unquestionably accessible in distinctive shades of white and diverse fabrics &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.artweddings.co.uk\/&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;http:\/\/www.artweddings.co.uk\/&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;poufy skirts arent required, there are numerous dresses with fabrics like crinoline that make it pouf out, yet its possbile to have them without&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.artweddings.co.uk\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/24\/small_image\/375x500\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/wedding\/weddingdress\/HS461042\/Sweetheart-Appliqued-Organza-A-Line-Wedding-Dress-with-Cascading-Ruffle-Skirt.jpg\" alt=\"Sweetheart-Appliqued-Organza-A-Line-Wedd\"&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901884,"PostDate":1438774930,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>Ive just been to one wedding shop (and alright, i confess...my wedding dress will be strapless haha) however there were a wide range of styles - some since quite a while ago sleeved ones (perhaps in light of the fact that i live in mexico and a percentage of the catholic weddings are in more progressive houses of worship), straps, topped sleeves, short dresses, grecian section dresses with a halterneck sort top and so on et cetera as a matter of fact the lion's share were strapless, yet different alternatives were unquestionably accessible in distinctive shades of white and diverse fabrics \u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.artweddings.co.uk\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong>http:\/\/www.artweddings.co.uk\/<\/strong><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>poufy skirts arent required, there are numerous dresses with fabrics like crinoline that make it pouf out, yet its possbile to have them without\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.artweddings.co.uk\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/24\/small_image\/375x500\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/wedding\/weddingdress\/HS461042\/Sweetheart-Appliqued-Organza-A-Line-Wedding-Dress-with-Cascading-Ruffle-Skirt.jpg\" alt=\"Sweetheart-Appliqued-Organza-A-Line-Wedd\"><\/span><\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dsspl2020@gmail.com","IpAddress":"117.213.14.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438774390,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rebbcaGJasso","Id":284290,"Name":"rebbcaGJasso","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"74225","Title":"my dressilyme wedding dress!","LastPostDate":1438774930},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
